{"Channel": {"name": "planning-onForceX", "channelID": "ch-orcex-60b1fb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-07-17T21:31:00", "text": "Overall, X-Genie has some strong features, but there are areas we can improve upon in our own product. Let's brainstorm how we can leverage our strengths to offer something even more compelling. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260717-8-c2eaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260717-8-c2eaf"}
