{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84b3cc1f", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T21:28:03", "text": "@here Dive into the Scikit-Optimize library, which offers tools for optimizing hyperparameters, similar to the functionality provided by ATF_AIX. https://scikit-optimize.github.io/stable/", "utterranceID": "20260624-85-89793"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-85-89793"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07ca0a78", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T21:30:00", "text": "On the documentation front, we need to expand the user guides and tutorials. @eid_2490c02c, Bob, do you think adding more visual aids or step-by-step videos would help with the parameter adjustment process?", "utterranceID": "20260624-3-a2fc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-3-a2fc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T21:31:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. Visual aids and interactive tutorials could significantly lower the learning curve. We should also consider a FAQ section addressing common user queries. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260624-4-06fc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-4-06fc2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T21:34:00", "text": "Regarding integration issues, we might need to expand our API support. Including more data formats and protocols could enhance compatibility with third-party data sources. This should be highlighted in the integration section.", "utterranceID": "20260624-5-e78d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-5-e78d9"}
