{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:43:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260924-1-86283"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-1-86283"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:45:00", "text": "Could it be due to inefficient data processing algorithms? If they don't scale well, that could explain the slowdown.", "utterranceID": "20260924-2-cf647"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-2-cf647"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T11:48:00", "text": "@eid_7c6dd6a6 Good point, Fiona. We should review the algorithms used and see if there's room for optimization.", "utterranceID": "20260924-3-1c3e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-3-1c3e0"}
