{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T07:30:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_extaix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260914-0-04c3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-0-04c3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:35:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-1e40f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-1e40f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:39:00", "text": "Hey @eid_3f2087c9, I think we should start by addressing the AI misinterpretation issue. We need to enhance the training data section in the document. We should specify the need for diverse datasets to improve AI understanding of user behaviors. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-ec417"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-ec417"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:42:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Also, we should add a section on improving the feedback loop for AI models. Continuous learning is crucial for accuracy. Maybe we can include a mechanism for users to provide feedback directly in the UI? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-b8304"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-b8304"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:44:00", "text": "For the UI issue, I suggest we add a subsection under 'Key Features' focusing on user onboarding and intuitive navigation. We need to simplify the layout and provide better guidance for new users. A walkthrough feature could be beneficial. 🧭", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-630f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-630f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:48:00", "text": "Regarding integration inconsistencies, we should emphasize the need for comprehensive testing across third-party applications in the 'Integration' section. Also, let's consider modularizing the integration architecture to adapt to API changes more easily. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-e978c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-e978c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:52:00", "text": "Good point, Ian. We should also include a note on performance optimization for large datasets. The 'Architecture' section should highlight the need for scalable data processing algorithms and adequate computational resources. ⚙️", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-2362e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-2362e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:55:00", "text": "For customization options, let's add a requirement for flexible feature design in the 'Key Features' section. We should ensure the architecture supports adaptability to diverse business needs. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-f0333"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-f0333"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T00:56:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the key changes: 
1. Enhance training data and feedback loop for AI models.
2. Simplify UI and improve onboarding.
3. Emphasize comprehensive testing and modular integration.
4. Optimize performance for large datasets.
5. Increase feature customization.

Next steps: I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-5ab08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-5ab08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-extAIX", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-274901"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f2087c9", "timestamp": "2026-09-17T06:02:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_extaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260917-0-42053"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260917-0-42053"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:35:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270206-0-7d8d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-0-7d8d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:37:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Synchronization Lag' issue. The AI Analysis Engine is processing outdated user behavior data due to delays in data synchronization. This is impacting CUST-0055, as users are receiving insights that aren't personalized, which could lead to frustration. @eid_0f6b0aea, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270206-1-495e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-1-495e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:40:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data synchronization lag issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270206-2-480e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-2-480e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:43:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Preference Model Drift' issue. The AI model has drifted from its original training parameters, causing misinterpretation of user preferences. This is affecting CUST-0016. @eid_92c62291, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270206-3-5faf2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-3-5faf2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:47:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the model drift issue and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Let's get those insights back on track! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270206-4-469fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-4-469fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:49:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Memory Leak in Data Processing Module'. It's causing the system to slow down, affecting the speed of insights generation and display. This is impacting CUST-0074. @eid_01942cf0, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270206-5-c8368"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-5-c8368"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:54:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll investigate the memory leak in the data processing module. We need to ensure users can access insights quickly. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270206-6-de0b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-6-de0b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T21:58:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open as you work through these issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any additional context or support. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270206-7-68869"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-7-68869"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0f6b0aea", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T22:00:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update you all once I have more info on the synchronization issue. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270206-8-4636f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-8-4636f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T22:05:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the model drift findings. 🧠", "utterranceID": "20270206-9-5f66a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-9-5f66a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01942cf0", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T22:10:00", "text": "I'll share my progress on the memory leak soon. Let's get these resolved! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270206-10-e406a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-10-e406a"}


