{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:57:00", "text": "And for update disruptions, we should include a section on update management and rollback procedures. Ensuring backward compatibility is crucial for reliability. 🔄", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-d26b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-d26b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:58:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_caa2e58d. We could also emphasize the importance of thorough testing before deployment in the technical section. 🧪", "utterranceID": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-9-ec3b0"}
