{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:36:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270129-2-329b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-2-329b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-29T13:38:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'Version Mismatch in Model Deployment'. This is causing discrepancies in predictions, affecting Customer CUST-0088. It's in the Model Management & Update Module. @eid_4df3bcc2, you're also on this one.", "utterranceID": "20270129-3-06832"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270129-3-06832"}
