{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f2474622", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:38:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the color coding issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🎨", "utterranceID": "20260902-2-11d2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-2-11d2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:41:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Weak Password Policy Enforcement' issue. The system is allowing weak passwords, which is a big security risk. This affects the Security & Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0014. @eid_9a7b2132, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260902-3-41729"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-3-41729"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:44:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll tighten up the password policy to enhance security. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260902-4-2a776"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-4-2a776"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:46:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Improper Session Token Expiry' issue. Session tokens aren't expiring as they should, which is another security risk. This also affects the Security & Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0004. @eid_399e4119, can you take care of this?", "utterranceID": "20260902-5-9587e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-5-9587e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:49:00", "text": "On it! I'll make sure the session tokens expire correctly to prevent unauthorized access. Thanks for the update! 🔑", "utterranceID": "20260902-6-9bb9d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-6-9bb9d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:54:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and secure. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or further clarification on these issues. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260902-7-edb3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-7-edb3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f2474622", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T16:57:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260902-8-24e12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-8-24e12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T17:01:00", "text": "Thanks, team! Let's make it happen. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260902-9-ce737"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-9-ce737"}
