{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T22:14:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent timestamp handling has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-3bd0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-3bd0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T22:16:00", "text": "The root cause was a discrepancy in time zone settings across different components of the system, which led to inconsistent timestamp recording.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-01f4a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-01f4a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T22:21:00", "text": "To fix this, I standardized the time zone settings across all components to UTC. This ensures that all timestamps are recorded consistently, aligning the sequence of events accurately.", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-c6690"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-c6690"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T22:22:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. This should really help with our flow analysis accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-b7224"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-b7224"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T22:25:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_399e4119! I've been seeing some oddities in the event sequences, so this fix is much appreciated.", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-3445d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-3445d"}
