{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T12:01:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for FForceAIX is that some users are experiencing reliability issues with the optimizer crashing during high-load scenarios. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0074.", "utterranceID": "20260607-0-7d1a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-0-7d1a0"}
