{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-03-26T18:40:00", "text": "Agreed, Fiona. Versatility is key in today's market.", "utterranceID": "20260325-7-6cbd0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-7-6cbd0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_104b8b57", "timestamp": "2026-03-26T18:43:00", "text": "And CUST-0065 reported that castAIX is highly reliable with minimal downtime, ensuring consistent availability.", "utterranceID": "20260325-8-3a946"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-8-3a946"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_69067a7c", "timestamp": "2026-03-26T18:45:00", "text": "Reliability is something we should definitely maintain. Kudos to the previous team for setting such a strong foundation.", "utterranceID": "20260325-9-7a2df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-9-7a2df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9fecc161", "timestamp": "2026-03-26T18:49:00", "text": "Yes, we should build on these strengths and continue to improve.", "utterranceID": "20260325-10-a7632"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260325-10-a7632"}
