{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:25:00", "text": "@eid_99835861 created this channel on 2026-09-11 18:25:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-ianjones-LeadForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-53655"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-53655"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:25:00", "text": "@eid_99835861 joined bug-ianjones-LeadForce. Also, @eid_3f4b2681, @eid_c39dc658, @eid_652e8cd0, @eid_07cc9100, @eid_9f4e2c6f joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-bdd26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-bdd26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:06:00", "text": "Hey team! 👋 We've got a few customer-reported issues that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-329f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-329f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:08:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Feature Drift Causes Inconsistent Scoring'. The AI Scoring Algorithm isn't reflecting changes in lead behavior over time, leading to inconsistent and outdated lead scores. This is impacting CUST-0020, and it could mean missed opportunities or wasted resources on low-quality leads. @eid_9f4e2c6f, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-3feb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-3feb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:13:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Scoring Algorithm and see what's causing the drift. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-33b1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-33b1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Misconfigured Export Permissions' issue. Users are able to export more data than they're authorized to, which could lead to data breaches. This is affecting CUST-0069. @eid_9f4e2c6f, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-1276e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-1276e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:19:00", "text": "Understood. I'll check the Data Export Module and fix the permissions. We definitely don't want any data breaches! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-7aaca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-7aaca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Lastly, we have an 'Improper Access Control in Export API' issue. Unauthorized users can access and export lead data, which is a big no-no. This is impacting CUST-0037. @eid_3f4b2681, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-ae35b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-ae35b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into the access control mechanisms in the Export API and tighten things up. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260911-6-9917e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-6-9917e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-7-c75b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-7-c75b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:29:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_99835861! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260911-8-5a937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-8-5a937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_99835861! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-9-80937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-9-80937"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:02:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for AIX is the limited integration with third-party CRM systems. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0040.", "utterranceID": "20260327-0-cef87"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-0-cef87"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:04:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Ian. It seems like this could be a technical issue, maybe due to incompatibility with various CRM APIs?", "utterranceID": "20260327-1-37308"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-1-37308"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:06:00", "text": "That's possible. The previous team might not have standardized integration protocols, which could be causing these disruptions.", "utterranceID": "20260327-2-0c729"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-2-0c729"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:09:00", "text": "Good point, Ian Brown. Also, could it be that there were limited resources allocated for developing and maintaining these integrations?", "utterranceID": "20260327-3-db0a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-3-db0a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:12:00", "text": "Fiona, I think you're onto something. If the team didn't have enough resources, that could definitely impact the integration quality.", "utterranceID": "20260327-4-0f14b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-4-0f14b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:14:00", "text": "Agreed. Plus, if the architecture isn't modular, it would be tough to support multiple CRM systems efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260327-5-04e52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-5-04e52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:18:00", "text": "Right. We should consider redesigning the architecture to be more modular in the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260327-6-a545b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-6-a545b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d72674d", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:19:00", "text": "Let's make sure we document these issues and potential solutions in the planning documents for the next AIX release.", "utterranceID": "20260327-7-0a6b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-7-0a6b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-01T03:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Fiona. I'll start drafting the documentation and share it with you all for feedback.", "utterranceID": "20260327-8-f0765"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260327-8-f0765"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T13:09:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about AIX in the latest release!", "utterranceID": "20260426-0-c3704"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260426-0-c3704"}
