{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect OAuth token handling has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20261129-0-8ac30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-0-8ac30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:12:00", "text": "To recap, the issue was that our API Integration Module wasn't refreshing expired OAuth tokens automatically. This led to unauthorized API requests and interruptions in data retrieval from Slack channels.", "utterranceID": "20261129-1-40bc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-1-40bc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:14:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian! What was causing the token refresh mechanism to fail?", "utterranceID": "20261129-2-121e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-2-121e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:18:00", "text": "Good question, @eid_fa6ec727. The root cause was a missing trigger in our token management logic. The system wasn't set up to initiate a refresh when a token expired.", "utterranceID": "20261129-3-561d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-3-561d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:19:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, Ian?", "utterranceID": "20261129-4-07641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-4-07641"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:23:00", "text": "I added a check for token expiration before each API request. If a token is expired, the system now automatically triggers a refresh and retries the request with the new token. This ensures uninterrupted data retrieval.", "utterranceID": "20261129-5-f54dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-5-f54dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:28:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261129-6-8fc36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-6-8fc36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:30:00", "text": "Agreed, great work! I'll keep an eye on the logs to ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261129-7-fc6d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-7-fc6d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:35:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d96fb219 and Fiona. Let me know if you notice any issues. I'll be monitoring the system as well.", "utterranceID": "20261129-8-5fb62"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-8-5fb62"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:29:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-6fd9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-6fd9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:30:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Slack API Integration Failure'. The integration with Slack's API is intermittently failing, causing gaps in the sentiment data on the dashboard. This affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server, impacting customer CUST-0087. @eid_fa6ec727, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-dca04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-dca04"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:35:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start investigating the API integration issues right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-1486b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-1486b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:38:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Delayed Sentiment Updates in Real-Time Dashboard'. The dashboard is experiencing delays in updating sentiment scores, which affects the same areas as the previous issue. This impacts customer CUST-0105. @eid_8658e19c, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-36b87"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-36b87"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:41:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the delays and see what's causing the lag. Let's get this sorted for CUST-0105. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-e115b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-e115b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:46:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Language Model Bias' issue. The sentiment analysis engine is showing bias towards certain phrases, which is skewing sentiment scores. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts customer CUST-0005. @eid_4df5d4b7, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-e2aaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-e2aaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:47:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the sentiment analysis engine and address the bias issue. We need to ensure accurate sentiment reports for our users. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-baf95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-baf95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:48:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to ask questions or share insights as you work through these. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261201-7-bd055"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-7-bd055"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:52:00", "text": "Will do! If anyone has insights on the API integration, let me know. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20261201-8-c31d5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-8-c31d5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:53:00", "text": "Same here, any tips on optimizing real-time updates are welcome! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261201-9-f759f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-9-f759f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T23:56:00", "text": "I'll reach out if I find any patterns in the bias issue. Let's get these fixed! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261201-10-d526f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-10-d526f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sentiment scores on the dashboard, titled 'Sentiment Model Drift', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-a22e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-a22e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:12:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis model hadn't been retrained with recent data, which led to outdated or inaccurate sentiment scores being displayed.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-ae66c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-ae66c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:17:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the model training pipeline to automatically incorporate new data every month. This ensures the model stays current and accurate. I've also added a monitoring system to alert us if the model's performance starts to degrade.", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:18:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. The monitoring system sounds like a solid addition.", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-46138"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-46138"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:23:00", "text": "@eid_31cb6db5 Thanks, Ian! This should definitely improve the accuracy of our sentiment scores. Let me know if you need any help with the monitoring system.", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-37214"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-37214"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:28:00", "text": "Thanks, David and Charlie! I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-7846b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-7846b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:07:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the time zone misalignment in data processing. After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261030-0-05849"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-0-05849"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:08:00", "text": "Hey David, can you explain why it's not a bug? The misalignment seemed to cause some confusion on the dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20261030-1-1655b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-1-1655b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:12:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_802e8eff. The backend server processes sentiment data using a default time zone setting. This is actually the expected behavior, as the system is designed to standardize data processing across different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-2-ee25c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-2-ee25c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:15:00", "text": "So, the time zone setting is intentional to ensure consistency in data processing?", "utterranceID": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-3-8b0fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:16:00", "text": "Exactly, Charlie. The default time zone setting ensures that all sentiment data is processed uniformly, regardless of the user's local time zone. This prevents discrepancies when comparing data from different regions.", "utterranceID": "20261030-4-30a75"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-4-30a75"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:19:00", "text": "Got it. So, it's more of a user misunderstanding rather than a bug. Did you take any steps to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-5-d1c6a"}
