puting for Slack workflow processing. Got it, I’ll handle this.\nAlice Taylor: Bob, if you need any architectural insights, feel free to loop me in.\nBob Miller: Thanks, Alice. I'll definitely reach out if needed.\nJulia Smith: Great, I think we're all set with the assignments. Let's make sure to keep the communication open and address any issues as they arise. Thanks, everyone!\nIan Davis: Thanks, Julia. Looking forward to seeing the progress in our next meeting.", "date": "2026-03-21T08:59:00", "document_type": "product-planning", "participants": ["eid_95f6d01c", "eid_f4f58faa", "eid_71c0d545", "eid_1f678d18", "eid_827a0ea9", "eid_2543da6a", "eid_c92d3e03", "eid_55f29a0d", "eid_1e8695b6", "eid_d96bfd9b", "eid_136119e9", "eid_18571957", "eid_e214d622", "eid_e3c15ff5", "eid_515ae627", "eid_686130c8", "eid_4812cbd8"], "id": "product_dev_flowAIX_2"}

