{"transcript": "Attendees\nIan Smith, Julia Taylor, Julia Davis, Ian Martinez, Emma Brown, George Jones, Charlie Davis, Alice Brown, George Brown, Bob Martinez, Julia Taylor, George Miller, Charlie Taylor, David Taylor, Emma Davis\nTranscript\nIan Smith: Alright team, let's get started with our sprint review. First, let's go over the status of our completed PRs. Julia, could you give us a quick update?\nJulia Taylor: Sure, Ian. As of now, we don't have any completed PRs to discuss. So, let's move on to the pending tasks and their corresponding PRs.\nJulia Davis: Sounds good. Let's start with the database optimization task. Alice, you submitted a PR for the database caching. Can you give us a brief on the current status?\nAlice Brown: Yes, I submitted the PR, but it needs some additional revisions. I realized there are some edge cases we need to handle better.\nEmma Brown: Thanks, Alice. Bob, you'll be working on a new PR for this task, right?\nBob Martinez: Yes, I confirm. I'll take care of this implementation and submit a new PR.\nIan Martinez: Great. Moving on to the predictive analytics task. Charlie, you’re up next. Can you update us on the automated model retraining pipeline?\nCharlie Davis: Sure, Ian. Julia submitted a PR, but it needs some revisions. I'll be working on a new PR to address those issues.\nEmma Brown: Thanks, Charlie. Just to confirm, you'll handle the new PR for the predictive analytics task?\nCharlie Davis: Got it, I’ll handle this.\nIan Martinez: Perfect. Now, let's discuss the UI/UX enhancements. Julia, you submitted a PR for the user feedback mechanism. Can you tell us where we stand?\nCharlie Taylor: Yes, I submitted it, but it needs some additional revisions. Emma, you'll be working on a new PR for this, right?\nJulia Taylor: Yes, I confirm. I’ll take care of this implementation and submit a new PR.\nEmma Brown: Great teamwork, everyone. Let's make sure we address all the feedback and get these PRs ready for the next sprint. Any questions or concerns before we wrap up?\nGeorge Jones: No questions from me. Everything seems clear.\nDavid Taylor: Same here. Looking forward to seeing these improvements in action.\nIan Smith: Alright, thanks everyone. Let's keep up the good work and push these tasks forward. Meeting adjourned.", "date": "2026-12-02T12:51:00", "document_type": "product-planning", "participants": ["eid_82e9fcef", "eid_fa16fefb", "eid_36319f22", "eid_3f2087c9", "eid_792330e0", "eid_5782059f", "eid_01942cf0", "eid_92c62291", "eid_b4d260c1", "eid_0f6b0aea", "eid_ecaa9084", "eid_8d6fe78d", "eid_14a5889d", "eid_2542cff3", "eid_88c661bc"], "id": "product_dev_ContextForce_8"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:29:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270225-0-902cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-0-902cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:34:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration' issue. Third-party applications are experiencing unexpected rate limiting, which is disrupting their access to contextual insights. This is affecting the API Authentication Module and impacting Customer ID: CUST-0025. @eid_ecaa9084, this one's for you. Can you take a look? 🙏", "utterranceID": "20270225-1-bafcb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-1-bafcb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:39:00", "text": "Got it, I'll dive into the API Authentication Module and see what's causing the rate limiting issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270225-2-0aaf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-2-0aaf9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:42:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Weak Encryption Algorithm Usage' issue. The data transmitted between the client and server is using an outdated encryption algorithm, which poses a risk of interception. This affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0058. @eid_14a5889d, can you handle this one? 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270225-3-7e950"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-3-7e950"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:44:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll start working on updating the encryption algorithm to ensure data security. Thanks for assigning this to me! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270225-4-ac825"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-4-ac825"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:45:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Man-in-the-Middle Attack Susceptibility' issue. Data packets are vulnerable during transmission due to a lack of secure channel establishment. This also affects the Data Transmission & Security Layer and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0006. @eid_2542cff3, can you take this on? 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270225-5-4ec21"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-5-4ec21"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:50:00", "text": "On it! I'll work on establishing a secure channel to prevent any interception. Thanks for the update! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270225-6-3ac52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-6-3ac52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:53:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or have questions. Let's get these issues resolved for our customers! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270225-7-12634"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-7-12634"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:55:00", "text": "Will do! Let's make sure our customers are happy. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270225-8-f8c10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-8-f8c10"}
