{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-02-25T20:58:00", "text": "Absolutely, team effort! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270225-10-574cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-10-574cd"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:17:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about 'Temporal Data Misinterpretation' where reports were showing misleading trends due to incorrect time-series data analysis.", "utterranceID": "20270308-0-790f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-0-790f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:19:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix. The behavior is actually expected due to a misconfiguration in the user settings.", "utterranceID": "20270308-1-cc048"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-1-cc048"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:24:00", "text": "The timestamps were being misinterpreted because the time zone settings were not correctly configured in the user profile. This led to the incorrect trend calculations.", "utterranceID": "20270308-2-17a0d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-2-17a0d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George. So, it's a user-side issue rather than a bug in our module?", "utterranceID": "20270308-3-3796a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-3-3796a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:32:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_fa16fefb. I verified the module's functionality with the correct settings, and it works as intended.", "utterranceID": "20270308-4-78452"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-4-78452"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:34:00", "text": "Good to know, George. Should we inform the users about the correct configuration to avoid future confusion?", "utterranceID": "20270308-5-e5f3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-5-e5f3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:37:00", "text": "Yes, Emma. I'll draft a quick guide on setting up the time zone correctly and share it with the support team to pass on to the users.", "utterranceID": "20270308-6-316b8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-6-316b8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:40:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Thanks for clarifying this, George!", "utterranceID": "20270308-7-fca79"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-7-fca79"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:43:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! I'll keep you all posted once the guide is ready.", "utterranceID": "20270308-8-776ba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-8-776ba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T12:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the 'Temporal Data Misinterpretation' bug has been reopened by CUST-0043. 🚨", "utterranceID": "20270310-0-0492f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-0-0492f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:04:00", "text": "Oh, that's unexpected! 😮 I thought we concluded it was due to a user settings misconfiguration. @eid_fa16fefb, do we have more details on why it was reopened?", "utterranceID": "20270310-1-4984a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-1-4984a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:09:00", "text": "Yes, @George. The customer insists the issue persists even after adjusting the settings as we recommended. They provided some new data samples that might help us see what's going wrong. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270310-2-2d9cd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-2-2d9cd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:10:00", "text": "Hmm, interesting. Maybe there's an edge case we missed? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270310-3-5f015"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-3-5f015"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:15:00", "text": "Could be, Emma. I'll take another look at it with the new data. @eid_fa16fefb, can you assign it back to me? I'll prioritize it and see if there's something we overlooked.", "utterranceID": "20270310-4-93bbe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-4-93bbe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:20:00", "text": "Sure thing, George. Reassigning it to you now. Let us know if you need any help or additional info. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270310-5-119c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-5-119c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T13:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia. I'll keep you all posted on what I find. Let's get this sorted for the customer! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270310-6-769c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-6-769c0"}
