{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T19:49:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270310-0-88dff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-0-88dff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T19:51:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Slow Response Time in Dashboard Loading'. The dashboard is taking too long to load, especially with large datasets. This affects the Database Querying & Dashboard UI and is impacting Customer CUST-0043. @eid_8d6fe78d, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270310-1-52b76"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-1-52b76"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T19:53:00", "text": "Got it! I'll look into the database queries and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270310-2-3e2e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-2-3e2e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T19:54:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Incorrect User Preference Insights'. The AI is generating insights that don't match user preferences, affecting the AI Analysis Engine. This is impacting Customer CUST-0095. @eid_ecaa9084, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270310-3-9df7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-3-9df7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T19:55:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the AI models and see why the preferences aren't aligning. Let's get this sorted! 🤖", "utterranceID": "20270310-4-b7906"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-4-b7906"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-10T20:00:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's 'Preference Misalignment in Contextual Insights'. Reports aren't aligning with user preferences, impacting Report Generation & Data Processing. Customer CUST-0101 is affected. @eid_14a5889d, can you take care of this?", "utterranceID": "20270310-5-19d4b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270310-5-19d4b"}
