{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T21:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect context interpretation titled 'Contextual Misinterpretation' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20270125-0-62476"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270125-0-62476"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T21:56:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_5782059f! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270125-1-72862"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270125-1-72862"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T21:59:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was a flaw in the context recognition algorithm. It was misinterpreting the situational context of user actions, which led to irrelevant or misleading insights.", "utterranceID": "20270125-2-a9bce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270125-2-a9bce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T22:02:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George Jones. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270125-3-89543"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270125-3-89543"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T22:05:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the algorithm to include a more robust context validation step. This ensures that the context is accurately identified before generating insights. Additionally, I added a fallback mechanism to handle ambiguous contexts more gracefully.", "utterranceID": "20270125-4-acd92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270125-4-acd92"}
