{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:58:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/30.", "utterranceID": "20260829-0-937aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-0-937aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:59:00", "text": "The root cause was that our authentication module was using outdated cryptographic algorithms like MD5 and SHA-1 for password storage, which are not secure enough.", "utterranceID": "20260829-1-0e754"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-1-0e754"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob! What changes did you make to fix this?", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-812b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-812b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:02:00", "text": "Good question, Alice. I updated the authentication module to use bcrypt for hashing passwords. Bcrypt is more secure as it incorporates a salt and is computationally intensive, making it much harder to crack.", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-ec609"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-ec609"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:03:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_b7702c98! Does this change affect any other parts of the system?", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-574b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-574b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:06:00", "text": "Thanks, David. The change is isolated to the password storage mechanism, so it shouldn't affect other parts of the system. However, I recommend everyone to test their modules just to be sure.", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-4224c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-4224c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:09:00", "text": "Will do, Bob. Thanks for the heads-up!", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-5255a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-5255a"}
