{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-06T07:02:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for pAIX is that the user interface can be overwhelming for new users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0114.", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-73ffc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-73ffc"}
