{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T21:58:00", "text": "That's a big win! Tailoring pitches is crucial for engagement.", "utterranceID": "20260704-3-35863"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-3-35863"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:03:00", "text": "Absolutely, George. What else did they say, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260704-4-c0070"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-4-c0070"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:04:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0102 appreciated the intuitive design of the pitch customization features. They said it enhances usability.", "utterranceID": "20260704-5-2cab2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-5-2cab2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_965867b8", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:09:00", "text": "Great to hear! Usability is always a top priority.", "utterranceID": "20260704-6-31d01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-6-31d01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:12:00", "text": "And what about the AI engine? Any feedback on that?", "utterranceID": "20260704-7-ea374"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-7-ea374"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:16:00", "text": "Yes, Hannah! Customer CUST-0111 reported that the AI engine quickly adapts to new data inputs, improving the relevance of generated pitches.", "utterranceID": "20260704-8-4f1e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-8-4f1e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:21:00", "text": "That's impressive. The previous team did a fantastic job with the AI engine.", "utterranceID": "20260704-9-d2459"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-9-d2459"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:22:00", "text": "Indeed, Julia. We should definitely build on these strengths moving forward.", "utterranceID": "20260704-10-6b080"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-10-6b080"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:23:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's keep this momentum going and continue to enhance these features.", "utterranceID": "20260704-11-ba47f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-11-ba47f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_965867b8", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T22:28:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Thanks for sharing, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20260704-12-91fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-12-91fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:48:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for pAIX is the limited integration options with popular CRM systems. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0114.", "utterranceID": "20260704-0-fa01d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-0-fa01d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:53:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Hannah. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current integration capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:56:00", "text": "Good point, George. I suspect the lack of API support or compatibility with major CRM platforms could be a technical cause.", "utterranceID": "20260704-2-81a1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-2-81a1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:59:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. It might also be a design oversight. Maybe there wasn't enough focus on integration features during the product development phase.", "utterranceID": "20260704-3-59cbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-3-59cbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:02:00", "text": "That's possible, George. We should also consider operational factors, like insufficient partnerships or collaborations with CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260704-4-d4e95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-4-d4e95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:06:00", "text": "I think we should start by reviewing the existing API documentation to see where the gaps are. @eid_469598db, do we have access to that?", "utterranceID": "20260704-5-54fb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-5-54fb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:09:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, we do. I'll share the link to the documentation after this meeting.", "utterranceID": "20260704-6-919e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-6-919e2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:14:00", "text": "Great. Once we identify the gaps, we can prioritize which CRM systems to focus on for better integration.", "utterranceID": "20260704-7-18cee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-7-18cee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:18:00", "text": "Let's make sure to document these customer issues in our planning documents for the next release of pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260704-8-113f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-8-113f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T10:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma. This will help us ensure that we address these integration issues effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260704-9-b5999"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-9-b5999"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:54:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of pAIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-ec922"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-ec922"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:55:10", "text": "@here Explore the capabilities of the OpenAI GPT-3 library, which powers many AI-driven applications like pAIX. Dive into its features and how it can be used for generating personalized content. https://github.com/openai/gpt-3", "utterranceID": "20260716-101-92e7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-101-92e7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T16:58:00", "text": "Hey @eid_c0df5be6, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. We need to enhance our NLP capabilities to capture more context-specific nuances. Maybe we can add a section in the Core AI Engine about expanding our training datasets to include more industry-specific data?", "utterranceID": "20260716-1-dba92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-1-dba92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:00:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Also, from a UX perspective, we should consider revising the User Interface section to include more intuitive onboarding features. This could help new users get up to speed faster and reduce the learning curve. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260716-2-20438"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-2-20438"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_888411ab", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:03:00", "text": "Good points, @eid_85a4de81 and @eid_59bbe6f6. For the integration issue, we should expand the System Architecture section to emphasize the need for broader CRM compatibility. This could involve developing more APIs or forming partnerships with major CRM providers.", "utterranceID": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-3-c6e7e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:04:00", "text": "On the performance side, we should definitely look into optimizing our backend processes. Maybe we can add a note in the System Architecture about implementing better load balancing and scaling strategies to handle peak traffic more efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260716-4-18ab5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-4-18ab5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:07:00", "text": "I think we should also address the reliability issues by enhancing our testing and quality assurance processes. Perhaps we can include a new section under Future Enhancements focusing on improving data quality and algorithm consistency across diverse datasets.", "utterranceID": "20260716-5-d79ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-5-d79ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_50da4819", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:10:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! For the Template Management System, maybe we can emphasize the need for more personalized content generation rather than relying on generic templates. This could help make our pitches more effective.", "utterranceID": "20260716-6-5d961"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-6-5d961"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T17:12:00", "text": "Thanks for all the input, team! Here's a quick summary of the changes: \n1. Expand Core AI Engine to include more industry-specific training data.\n2. Revise User Interface to improve onboarding.\n3. Enhance System Architecture for better CRM integration and load handling.\n4. Add a section on improving data quality and algorithm consistency.\n5. Focus Template Management on personalized content generation.\nLet's aim to have a draft with these updates by next week. I'll coordinate with each of you to ensure we cover all bases. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260716-7-187a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-7-187a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-16T22:59:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_product_vision_document|Product Vision Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260716-0-4fac2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260716-0-4fac2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-07-18T00:26:00", "text": "@eid_1cfce648 joined planning-pAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260718-106-9d544"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260718-106-9d544"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:29:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the recent release that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260719-0-f5d40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-0-f5d40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:32:00", "text": "Hey @eid_66d09012, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. The document mentions personalization, but it seems like we're not capturing enough industry-specific nuances. We might need to expand our training data and enhance our NLP capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260719-1-17a28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-1-17a28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_ee9ca887. From a UX perspective, we should also look at how we're using templates. Over-reliance on generic templates might be part of the problem. Maybe we can add a section on developing more dynamic, context-aware templates?", "utterranceID": "20260719-2-dfe90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-2-dfe90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:40:00", "text": "Good point, @eid_59bbe6f6. We should also consider adding a feature for users to provide feedback on pitch quality directly in the UI. This could help the AI learn and adapt more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:45:00", "text": "For the performance issues, it seems like we need to revisit our server capacity and load balancing strategies. The document mentions scalability, but we might need more specific strategies for peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260719-4-5782a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-4-5782a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:46:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_71a4de1d. We should also look into optimizing backend processes. Maybe we can add a section on performance optimization strategies in the document?", "utterranceID": "20260719-5-719f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-5-719f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:49:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, the document talks about seamless integration, but we need more API support and partnerships. We should expand on this in the 'Future Enhancements' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-6-65b3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-6-65b3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:53:00", "text": "And for the UI, we need to simplify it for new users. Adding a user-friendly onboarding process or tutorials could help. Let's include this in the 'User Interface' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-7-5614b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-7-5614b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:58:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 😊 To summarize, we'll enhance the AI engine with more industry-specific data and NLP capabilities, improve template dynamics, optimize server performance, expand CRM integration, and simplify the UI with better onboarding. I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to discuss implementation. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T15:59:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect feature extraction titled 'Feature Extraction Failure' has been resolved. You can check out the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/58.", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-ad4c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-ad4c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:03:00", "text": "The root cause was an error in the feature extraction module. It was overlooking critical customer attributes like recent purchase history and engagement metrics.", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-a7ac9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-a7ac9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:04:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the module to correctly parse and include these attributes by adjusting the data parsing logic and adding additional checks for null values. This ensures all relevant customer data is captured for personalized pitches.", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-9e386"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-9e386"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:06:00", "text": "Great work, Bob! Thanks for the quick turnaround on this. @eid_38700e5f", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-a7871"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-a7871"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob. This should really improve the personalization of our pitches. I'll run some tests to confirm everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-84faa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-84faa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dd1ff0ca", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:13:00", "text": "Appreciate the update, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my end to ensure this fix is solid.", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-1054a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-1054a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_38700e5f", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:18:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_ee9ca887, let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. @David, I'll reach out if I need further assistance. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-5cccc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-5cccc"}

