inked to the 'Integrate Context Awareness into AI Search Queries' PR. Can you confirm?\nAlice Taylor: I confirm, George. I'll take care of integrating context awareness into our AI search queries using session data.\nFiona Davis: Perfect. Lastly, we need to address 'Improving integration with third-party applications'. David Garcia, your PR needs some revisions. Can you update us on that?\nDavid Garcia: Yes, Fiona. I've received feedback and will make the necessary revisions to ensure our integration scenarios are functioning as expected.\nCharlie Miller: And Bob, you'll be working on a new PR for this task. Are you set to start?\nBob Jones: Absolutely, Charlie. I'll submit a new PR once I've completed the integration tests.\nJulia Taylor: Great teamwork, everyone. Let's keep up the momentum and ensure we meet our sprint goals. If there are no further questions, let's wrap up.\nDavid Taylor: Just a quick note, if anyone needs assistance with their tasks, feel free to reach out. Collaboration is key.\nDavid Williams: Thanks, David. We'll keep that in mind. Looking forward to another productive sprint.", "date": "2027-01-02T12:34:00", "document_type": "product-planning", "participants": ["eid_d0b6cb92", "eid_439a052b", "eid_6d14c4ec", "eid_887367ca", "eid_5b61c55e", "eid_efc9418c", "eid_aa99608e", "eid_9b8bc088", "eid_e5715d9e", "eid_160fca3c", "eid_13786f09", "eid_7db4431d", "eid_3fa288cf", "eid_990f697c", "eid_b7f0726e", "eid_0aa7db32", "eid_7bd14403", "eid_e7622cfb", "eid_51f0b41f", "eid_070b6e41", "eid_12c203a5", "eid_681e9def", "eid_b20b58ad", "eid_4eec2a5a"], "id": "product_dev_SearchForce_7"}

