r PR needs additional revisions. Alice, you'll be working on a new PR for this task.\nAlice Jones: Got it, I'll handle this and submit a new PR soon.\nJulia Taylor: Next, we have 'Implementation of context awareness algorithms'. Alice Taylor, you'll be setting up a new database table for session data storage.\nAlice Taylor: I confirm, I'll take care of this implementation.\nJulia Taylor: Moving on, we have 'Improving integration with third-party applications'. David Garcia, you'll be updating the API for compatibility with the latest versions of third-party applications.\nDavid Garcia: Got it, I'll ensure the API is up to date and compatible.\nJulia Taylor: Lastly, we have 'Enhancing user interface'. Hannah, you'll be working on implementing the responsive auto-suggestions feature.\nHannah Brown: I confirm, I'll take care of this feature.\nJulia Taylor: Great, thanks everyone. Let's make sure we stay on track and reach out if you need any help. That's it for today. Have a productive sprint!", "date": "2026-11-03T03:23:00", "document_type": "product-planning", "participants": ["eid_d0b6cb92", "eid_439a052b", "eid_6d14c4ec", "eid_887367ca", "eid_5b61c55e", "eid_efc9418c", "eid_aa99608e", "eid_9b8bc088", "eid_e5715d9e", "eid_160fca3c", "eid_13786f09", "eid_7db4431d", "eid_3fa288cf", "eid_990f697c", "eid_b7f0726e", "eid_0aa7db32", "eid_7bd14403", "eid_e7622cfb", "eid_51f0b41f", "eid_070b6e41", "eid_12c203a5", "eid_681e9def", "eid_b20b58ad", "eid_4eec2a5a"], "id": "product_dev_SearchForce_3"}

