calls.text:
{"answer":"Based on the documents, the following approved PRs for improving third-party integration were put on hold (should be closed) due to the product direction shift away from third-party integrations:

- **PR #15** – "Update API documentation for third-party integration" (https://github.com/salesforce/shAIX/pull/15) — Approved by Hannah Brown (eid_51f0b41f) and Fiona Taylor (eid_e7622cfb), but the team explicitly decided on 2026-12-14 to hold off on merging it because the new product direction may no longer require third-party integrations as documented.

Other third-party integration PRs mentioned (#3, #7, #11, #23) were approved/merged for different reasons (error handling, API compatibility updates, integration tests) and were not flagged for closure — only PR #15 was explicitly discussed as no longer aligned with product direction and should not be merged/should be closed."}

