{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:03:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! This is spot on. I'll dive into the Redis PR to understand their approach to cache invalidation. It could help us ensure our Real-Time Dashboard is always up-to-date. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260822-4-f7714"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-4-f7714"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:07:00", "text": "Awesome, Ian! Lastly, there's a bug in NLTK titled 'Incorrect Negation Handling in Sentiment Analysis'. It highlights issues with negations not being properly parsed, leading to inaccurate sentiment scores. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/nltk/nltk/pull/153. David, this seems directly related to our negation handling error. Any insights?", "utterranceID": "20260822-5-07fe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-5-07fe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! This is exactly what we need. I'll review the NLTK PR to see how they tackled the negation parsing. It might offer some valuable strategies for improving our sentiment analysis engine. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-6-45bb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-6-45bb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:12:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's use these insights to enhance our solutions. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or further discussion. Let's keep pushing forward! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260822-7-97b8f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-7-97b8f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:13:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! Let's get these issues resolved. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260822-8-2278c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-8-2278c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T15:16:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, Charlie! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-9-04cea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-9-04cea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:30:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20260825-0-debe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-0-debe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:34:00", "text": "The root cause was an insufficient connection pool size and a lack of connection reuse strategies, which led to the pool being exhausted under high load conditions.", "utterranceID": "20260825-1-77418"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-1-77418"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the connection pool size and implemented a connection reuse strategy that efficiently manages idle connections. This should prevent the pool from being exhausted during peak loads.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-19303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-19303"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:42:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20260825-3-232a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-3-232a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! This should really help with the delays we've been experiencing. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20260825-4-d260b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-4-d260b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Charlie. Please let me know if you notice any further issues. I'll be monitoring the system closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20260825-5-ef489"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-5-ef489"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the weak password policy enforcement. The concern was that our system allows users to set weak passwords, potentially making it easier for brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-0-ed551"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-0-ed551"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:49:00", "text": "After reviewing the system configuration and policies, I found that this is actually expected behavior. Our current setup is designed to allow flexibility for users who prefer simpler passwords, as long as they are aware of the risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-1-6129b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-1-6129b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:54:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, there's no need for a fix because it's a user choice issue?", "utterranceID": "20260912-2-1ca49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-2-1ca49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T00:59:00", "text": "Exactly, Bob. We provide users with the option to set stronger passwords, and we also have additional security measures in place, like two-factor authentication, to mitigate potential risks.", "utterranceID": "20260912-3-279e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-3-279e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:01:00", "text": "That makes sense. Did you check if there were any misconfigurations that might have led to this report?", "utterranceID": "20260912-4-20c25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-4-20c25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:03:00", "text": "Yes, Julia. I verified the configurations and everything is set up as intended. The report seems to stem from a misunderstanding of our policy flexibility rather than a technical issue.", "utterranceID": "20260912-5-ae0da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-5-ae0da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:08:00", "text": "Good to know, Ian. Should we consider updating our documentation to make this clearer to users?", "utterranceID": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-6-e2dfd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:13:00", "text": "That's a great idea, Emma. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to ensure our password policy and security measures are clearly communicated to users.", "utterranceID": "20260912-7-68edb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-7-68edb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:18:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Appreciate the thorough review and follow-up on this.", "utterranceID": "20260912-8-8dbb9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-8-8dbb9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-09-13T01:20:00", "text": "No problem, Bob. If anyone has further questions or concerns, feel free to reach out!", "utterranceID": "20260912-9-a5680"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260912-9-a5680"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T09:28:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260914-0-af559"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-0-af559"}
