{"answer":"Two PRs related to the Security - Data encryption feature were reverted due to changes in product direction:

1. **PR #3** - "Implement AES-256 Encryption for Data at Rest" → reverted by **PR #5**: https://github.com/salesforce/ainAIX/pull/5 (reason: product team pivoted away from storing sensitive data as originally planned, making the encryption redundant)

