{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T19:20:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Freezes During High-Volume Data Visualization' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20261106-0-61cf1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-0-61cf1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T19:23:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as inefficient rendering algorithms that struggled with large datasets. This caused the UI to become unresponsive.", "utterranceID": "20261106-1-eed31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-1-eed31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T19:28:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the rendering process by implementing a more efficient data chunking strategy and leveraging Web Workers to handle the rendering tasks asynchronously. This should prevent the UI from freezing even with large datasets.", "utterranceID": "20261106-2-0a034"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-2-0a034"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T19:32:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_d098d618! This was a critical issue for our users. Thanks for addressing it so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261106-3-dcdc8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261106-3-dcdc8"}
