{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:17:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261109-1-77c83"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-1-77c83"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:21:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the optimization parameters. This led to suboptimal routing of API requests, which ironically increased the response time instead of reducing it.", "utterranceID": "20261109-2-692b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-2-692b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261109-3-b0b35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-3-b0b35"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T02:29:00", "text": "To resolve it, I adjusted the optimization parameters to ensure that the routing logic prioritizes the shortest path for API requests. I also added a validation step to catch any similar misconfigurations in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261109-4-d2694"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261109-4-d2694"}
