{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:58:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/30.", "utterranceID": "20260829-0-937aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-0-937aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:59:00", "text": "The root cause was that our authentication module was using outdated cryptographic algorithms like MD5 and SHA-1 for password storage, which are not secure enough.", "utterranceID": "20260829-1-0e754"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-1-0e754"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob! What changes did you make to fix this?", "utterranceID": "20260829-2-812b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-2-812b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:02:00", "text": "Good question, Alice. I updated the authentication module to use bcrypt for hashing passwords. Bcrypt is more secure as it incorporates a salt and is computationally intensive, making it much harder to crack.", "utterranceID": "20260829-3-ec609"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-3-ec609"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:03:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_b7702c98! Does this change affect any other parts of the system?", "utterranceID": "20260829-4-574b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-4-574b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:06:00", "text": "Thanks, David. The change is isolated to the password storage mechanism, so it shouldn't affect other parts of the system. However, I recommend everyone to test their modules just to be sure.", "utterranceID": "20260829-5-4224c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-5-4224c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:09:00", "text": "Will do, Bob. Thanks for the heads-up!", "utterranceID": "20260829-6-5255a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-6-5255a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:10:00", "text": "I'll run some tests on my end too. Thanks for the quick resolution!", "utterranceID": "20260829-7-106d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-7-106d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T18:14:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20260829-8-2e1b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260829-8-2e1b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:22:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect forecasts due to a data preprocessing error has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/31.", "utterranceID": "20260901-0-25380"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-0-25380"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:24:00", "text": "The root cause was that our data preprocessing module wasn't correctly identifying and handling outliers, which skewed the input data and led to inaccurate trend predictions.", "utterranceID": "20260901-1-4a903"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-1-4a903"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:28:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the outlier detection algorithm to use a more robust statistical method, which now accurately flags and processes outliers before the data is fed into the model.", "utterranceID": "20260901-2-ab9bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-2-ab9bf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:32:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll review the changes in the PR.", "utterranceID": "20260901-3-e4b73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-3-e4b73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_57e922c4! This should really improve our forecast accuracy. Let me know if you need any help with testing.", "utterranceID": "20260901-4-0c66c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-4-0c66c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:39:00", "text": "Thanks, David and Bob! I've already run some tests, and everything looks good. But feel free to run additional tests if you have any specific scenarios in mind.", "utterranceID": "20260901-5-66803"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-5-66803"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:41:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. Let's aim to deploy this fix by the end of the week if everything checks out.", "utterranceID": "20260901-6-7fa64"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-6-7fa64"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T07:45:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Thanks again, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20260901-7-1ed66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260901-7-1ed66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:19:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/32.", "utterranceID": "20260904-0-5857e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-0-5857e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:23:00", "text": "The root cause was that the query optimizer was selecting suboptimal execution plans due to outdated statistics and missing indexes. This led to prolonged execution times for complex forecast data retrieval queries.", "utterranceID": "20260904-1-8ce94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-1-8ce94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:25:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the database statistics and added the necessary indexes to ensure the query optimizer can accurately estimate the cost of different execution paths. This should significantly improve the execution times.", "utterranceID": "20260904-2-01c86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-2-01c86"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:27:00", "text": "Great work, Bob! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20260904-3-d725b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-3-d725b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:29:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_b7702c98! This should help a lot with the performance issues we've been seeing. I'll also run some tests on my end.", "utterranceID": "20260904-4-07d37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-4-07d37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T21:34:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice and David. Let me know if you notice any other issues. I'm here to help!", "utterranceID": "20260904-5-c6b46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260904-5-c6b46"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:35:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261127-0-72171"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-0-72171"}
