{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0deececb", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:01:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_e6d2ec9d! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270126-1-ae242"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-1-ae242"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:02:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was the training dataset we used. It contained inherent biases that skewed the AI model's pitch generation, favoring certain demographics over others.", "utterranceID": "20270126-2-7857b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-2-7857b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_022d1fd9", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:06:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270126-3-dd725"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-3-dd725"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e6d2ec9d", "timestamp": "2027-01-26T17:09:00", "text": "To address the issue, we curated a more balanced training dataset that better represents the diverse needs of our target audience. We also implemented a bias detection and mitigation algorithm to ensure future datasets remain unbiased.", "utterranceID": "20270126-4-a97ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270126-4-a97ad"}
