{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:23:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was an overly aggressive rate limiting configuration on our API gateway. It was set too low, which prevented complete data synchronization from external sources, leading to partial customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20270228-2-906a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-2-906a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270228-3-32b73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-3-32b73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:29:00", "text": "To resolve it, I adjusted the rate limiting settings to a more balanced threshold that accommodates our peak data retrieval needs without overwhelming the system. I also added monitoring to alert us if we approach the new limit.", "utterranceID": "20270228-4-55e3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-4-55e3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:30:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_2e1d6568! That should help prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270228-5-56b3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-5-56b3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:33:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270228-6-7830e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-6-7830e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T21:37:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. I'll keep an eye on it and let you know if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270228-7-3790a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-7-3790a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:29:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the recent release that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260719-0-f5d40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-0-f5d40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:32:00", "text": "Hey @eid_66d09012, I think we should start by addressing the AI-generated pitches issue. The document mentions personalization, but it seems like we're not capturing enough industry-specific nuances. We might need to expand our training data and enhance our NLP capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260719-1-17a28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-1-17a28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_59bbe6f6", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:35:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_ee9ca887. From a UX perspective, we should also look at how we're using templates. Over-reliance on generic templates might be part of the problem. Maybe we can add a section on developing more dynamic, context-aware templates?", "utterranceID": "20260719-2-dfe90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-2-dfe90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:40:00", "text": "Good point, @eid_59bbe6f6. We should also consider adding a feature for users to provide feedback on pitch quality directly in the UI. This could help the AI learn and adapt more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-3-5e1a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:45:00", "text": "For the performance issues, it seems like we need to revisit our server capacity and load balancing strategies. The document mentions scalability, but we might need more specific strategies for peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260719-4-5782a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-4-5782a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:46:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_71a4de1d. We should also look into optimizing backend processes. Maybe we can add a section on performance optimization strategies in the document?", "utterranceID": "20260719-5-719f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-5-719f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:49:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, the document talks about seamless integration, but we need more API support and partnerships. We should expand on this in the 'Future Enhancements' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-6-65b3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-6-65b3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:53:00", "text": "And for the UI, we need to simplify it for new users. Adding a user-friendly onboarding process or tutorials could help. Let's include this in the 'User Interface' section.", "utterranceID": "20260719-7-5614b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-7-5614b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T10:58:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 😊 To summarize, we'll enhance the AI engine with more industry-specific data and NLP capabilities, improve template dynamics, optimize server performance, expand CRM integration, and simplify the UI with better onboarding. I'll update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to discuss implementation. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260719-8-3e9e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-21T20:32:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260721-0-6a429"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260721-0-6a429"}

