{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgemiller-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-87f4a7"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ee9ca887", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T16:04:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Database Query Bottleneck' issue. The sales pitch generation is delayed due to inefficient database queries, especially with large customer profiles. This affects our Backend Infrastructure & Performance. Customer CUST-0018 is impacted, and they're facing productivity losses and frustration. @eid_0deececb, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261209-1-6b092"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-1-6b092"}
