{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T19:07:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency handling flaw. Simultaneous requests for pitch generation are causing race conditions, leading to delays and inconsistent results. This is impacting our backend infrastructure and performance, and it's affecting customer CUST-0067. @eid_f66c3942, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261127-1-fd12e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-1-fd12e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f66c3942", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T19:12:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the backend infrastructure and see what's causing these race conditions. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261127-2-a2178"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-2-a2178"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3431e6"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T19:15:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with incorrect sentiment analysis. The module is misinterpreting customer feedback, which is leading to inappropriate tone and content in the generated pitches. This affects our AI model and personalization engine, impacting customer CUST-0050. @eid_8b67a68f, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261127-3-8b7e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-3-8b7e6"}
