{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect timestamps in SentimentForce due to timezone misalignment has been resolved. 🎉 You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/48", "utterranceID": "20261219-0-37452"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-0-37452"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:30:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_13cb0e90! Can you give us a quick rundown of what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:32:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our API Integration Module wasn't converting timestamps to a consistent timezone before processing. This led to temporal data inconsistencies and inaccurate sentiment trends.", "utterranceID": "20261219-2-87113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-2-87113"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261219-3-56141"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-3-56141"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:40:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the API Integration Module to include a timezone conversion step. Now, all incoming timestamps are converted to UTC before any processing occurs. This ensures consistency across all data points.", "utterranceID": "20261219-4-917da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-4-917da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:41:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Julia!", "utterranceID": "20261219-5-9a8fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-5-9a8fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:43:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_13cb0e90! Let us know if there's anything else we need to test on our end.", "utterranceID": "20261219-6-92fcf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-6-92fcf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma and Ian! I'll keep you posted if any further testing is needed, but for now, everything looks good. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261219-7-a8981"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-7-a8981"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:17:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent sentiment scoring across channels has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/49.", "utterranceID": "20261221-0-5835d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-0-5835d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:19:00", "text": "Great news, Ian! What was causing the inconsistency?", "utterranceID": "20261221-1-0e5f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-1-0e5f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:21:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis engine didn't account for channel-specific language nuances or context. This led to significant variations in sentiment scores for similar messages across different channels.", "utterranceID": "20261221-2-72918"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-2-72918"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261221-3-3e131"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-3-3e131"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:26:00", "text": "To address the issue, I implemented a context-aware layer in the sentiment analysis engine. This layer now considers channel-specific language patterns and adjusts the sentiment scoring accordingly. This should ensure more consistent results across different channels.", "utterranceID": "20261221-4-123a6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-4-123a6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:29:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid solution, Ian. Thanks for tackling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261221-5-00928"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-5-00928"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:32:00", "text": "Yes, thanks @eid_8658e19c! I'll keep an eye on the sentiment reports to ensure everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261221-6-07f4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-6-07f4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-21T13:36:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you notice any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20261221-7-64aef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261221-7-64aef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:54:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/50.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-3c8cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:57:00", "text": "The root cause was an inadequate cache size and improper cache invalidation policies, which led to frequent cache misses and increased database load for sentiment data queries.", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-b7d89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-b7d89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T00:58:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the cache size and implemented a more efficient cache invalidation strategy. This should significantly reduce the number of cache misses and alleviate the database load.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-62b27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-62b27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:01:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The new caching strategy should help improve our system's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-ab5fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-25T01:05:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_8658e19c! I'll monitor the database load over the next few days to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261224-4-0cb86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-4-0cb86"}
