{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamartinez-ContentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a1e3f0"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4350bf70", "timestamp": "2026-08-29T01:29:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inaccurate Content Tagging Due to Synonym Overlap'. The NLP module is tagging content incorrectly, which is affecting the relevance of recommendations for CUST-0063. This is crucial as it impacts sales efficiency. @eid_e6a024f6, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20260828-3-d672a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-3-d672a"}
