{"title": "Implement User Authentication Endpoints", "summary": "Develop endpoints for user authentication, including login and registration functionalities, to secure the API.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/9", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "9", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_54905dcb"}, "created_at": "2026-10-20T00:12:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_4b38019b"}, "comment": "The endpoints for login and registration look solid, and I appreciate the use of bcrypt for password hashing. However, the token validation logic needs revision as it doesn't handle expired tokens correctly. Please address this issue.", "submitted_at": "2026-10-20T12:16:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_2347b567"}, "comment": "I agree with the feedback on the token validation logic. Additionally, please add more unit tests for the token generation and validation process to ensure everything works as expected. Great job on securing the user data!", "submitted_at": "2026-10-20T12:19:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_9"}

{"title": "Add Support for New Sensor Protocols", "summary": "Implement support for additional sensor protocols to enhance device compatibility. This PR focuses on updating the device layer to recognize and process data from newly identified sensor types.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/EF_AIX/pull/1", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "1", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_2347b567"}, "created_at": "2026-09-26T08:53:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_4df3bcc2"}, "comment": "The device layer updates look solid and recognize the new protocols well. However, the unit tests don't cover all the new sensor protocols. Please add those tests.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-26T16:15:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_4b38019b"}, "comment": "Great work on the implementation! The documentation needs more detail on the new protocols supported. Please expand on that section.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-26T16:21:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_EF_AIX_pull_1"}
