{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-15T21:49:00", "text": "Definitely sounds like our progress bar issue! I'll check out how they tackled the real-time update problem and see if we can implement something similar. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261215-4-07e0d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261215-4-07e0d"}
