{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:30:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that our AI model hadn't been retrained to account for recent shifts in lead engagement patterns. This led to feature drift, causing the scoring algorithm to produce inconsistent and outdated lead scores.", "utterranceID": "20261001-2-089c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-2-089c7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:33:00", "text": "Got it, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261001-3-9ae18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-3-9ae18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:35:00", "text": "@eid_99835861, I addressed the issue by updating our model retraining schedule. Now, the model will be retrained every two weeks to ensure it captures any shifts in lead behavior. Additionally, I implemented a monitoring system to alert us if feature drift is detected in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261001-4-17ab6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261001-4-17ab6"}
