{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-10-13T03:36:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, there's a 'UI Lag Due to Excessive DOM Updates'. This is impacting the User Interface, making it hard for users to perform other tasks during the import process. Customer CUST-0032 is affected. @eid_3f4b2681, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261013-3-7eab9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261013-3-7eab9"}
