{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:50:00", "text": "The issue is titled 'Model Drift in Time-Series Forecasting'. Time-series models aren't adapting to new data trends, leading to inaccurate predictions. Sounds familiar, right? Here's the PR link: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/605", "utterranceID": "20260914-1-ef4d2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-1-ef4d2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:54:00", "text": "This is quite similar to our 'Feature Drift Causes Inconsistent Scoring' issue. I'll review their approach to see if we can apply any of their solutions to our AI Scoring Algorithm. Thanks for sharing, Ian! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260914-2-84668"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-2-84668"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:58:00", "text": "Great, Ian Brown! Next, we have an issue from Apache Kafka titled 'Unauthorized Topic Access'. Users can consume messages from topics they shouldn't have access to, which could lead to data leaks. Check it out here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/606", "utterranceID": "20260914-3-fc9a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-3-fc9a9"}
