{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T05:56:00", "text": "I updated the permission settings in the export module to correctly map user roles to their respective data access levels. This ensures that users can only export data they are authorized to access. We also added additional checks to validate permissions before any export action is performed.", "utterranceID": "20261003-4-02377"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-4-02377"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T06:01:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261003-5-d94e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261003-5-d94e9"}
