{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T03:55:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Fragmentation Issues' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/44.", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-44007"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-44007"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:00:00", "text": "The root cause was frequent updates and deletions in our database tables without regular defragmentation, which led to fragmented data storage and increased I/O operations.", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-20be0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-20be0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:01:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a scheduled defragmentation process that runs during off-peak hours. This should help maintain optimal data retrieval speeds by reducing fragmentation.", "utterranceID": "20261113-2-05847"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-2-05847"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:06:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13cb0e90! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The scheduled defragmentation sounds like a solid solution.", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-22814"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-22814"}
