{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T00:19:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the UI components and see how we can reposition those error messages. Let's make sure our users can interact with the system smoothly. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261105-4-f118a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-4-f118a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T00:20:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Graphical Artifacts in Parameter Charts'. Users are seeing graphical artifacts in parameter charts, which is affecting their ability to interpret model performance. This is also impacting the User Interface and customer CUST-0012. @eid_9307fe85, could you handle this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20261105-5-8da9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261105-5-8da9a"}
