{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6a0f49ba", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T00:41:00", "text": "Hey everyone, yes, I approved the PR because it seemed aligned with our goals at the time. Can someone clarify how our product direction has changed?", "utterranceID": "20261014-1-272b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-1-272b6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_061285c7", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T00:45:00", "text": "From what I understand, we're shifting focus away from real-time updates to prioritize other features. This PR might not be necessary anymore.", "utterranceID": "20261014-2-08c88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-2-08c88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_04a698e5", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T00:48:00", "text": "I approved it too. If the real-time updates are no longer a priority, it makes sense to discuss reverting it. @eid_65324b8a, could you provide some insight on the impact of this PR?", "utterranceID": "20261014-3-62d29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-3-62d29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_65324b8a", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T00:53:00", "text": "Sure, the PR optimizes backend processes specifically for real-time updates. If we're not focusing on that, reverting it could prevent unnecessary complexity in our codebase.", "utterranceID": "20261014-4-d248f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-4-d248f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c46088d", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T00:58:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification. It seems like reverting might be the best option to keep our codebase clean and aligned with our current goals.", "utterranceID": "20261014-5-413a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-5-413a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0719bc3e", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T01:00:00", "text": "Agreed. We should revert it to avoid maintaining code that doesn't serve our current objectives.", "utterranceID": "20261014-6-d424d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-6-d424d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f22371d", "timestamp": "2026-10-15T01:02:00", "text": "Alright, @eid_65324b8a, could you please handle reverting the PR? Let us know if you need any assistance.", "utterranceID": "20261014-7-1bbd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261014-7-1bbd8"}
