{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-ConnectForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c583cf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-07-09T10:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Weak Encryption Algorithms' issue. The AI Connector is using outdated encryption, which is a risk for data in transit. This affects Network Security and is also impacting customer CUST-0017. @eid_d098d618, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260709-3-ea600"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260709-3-ea600"}
