{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the customer has reopened the bug titled 'High Latency in API Calls'. It seems the issue is back. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270111-0-b468d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-0-b468d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:12:00", "text": "Oh no! I thought we had that one resolved. Let me take a look at the details again. @eid_82e9fcef, do we have any new information from the customer?", "utterranceID": "20270111-1-9699c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-1-9699c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:16:00", "text": "Not much yet, Ian. They just reported that the latency issue is impacting their dashboard insights again. We might need to dig deeper this time. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270111-2-07dd5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-2-07dd5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:19:00", "text": "That's unfortunate. @Alice, do you need any help with this? Maybe we can pair up to troubleshoot. 🤝", "utterranceID": "20270111-3-dceaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-3-dceaa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:24:00", "text": "Thanks, George! I might take you up on that offer. Let me first revisit the previous fix and see if there's anything we missed. I'll keep you posted. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270111-4-c2179"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-4-c2179"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:28:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let's aim to get this resolved quickly. Let us know if you need any additional resources or info from the customer. Thanks, Alice! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270111-5-94ea6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-5-94ea6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T07:31:00", "text": "Will do! I'll start by reviewing the logs and the previous PR. Hopefully, we can pinpoint the issue soon. 🤞", "utterranceID": "20270111-6-0c69e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-6-0c69e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:13:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Behavioral Data Overfitting' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ContextForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20270111-0-9bc0c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-0-9bc0c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:18:00", "text": "Great news, George! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270111-1-1220f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-1-1220f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:23:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_92c62291. The root cause was that our training dataset was too narrow and lacked diversity. This caused the AI model to overfit to a limited set of user behaviors, which meant it couldn't generalize insights across a broader range of actions.", "utterranceID": "20270111-2-d6b85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-2-d6b85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:25:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270111-3-3506b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-3-3506b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:29:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I expanded the training dataset by incorporating a more diverse set of user behavior data. Additionally, I implemented data augmentation techniques to artificially increase the diversity of the training data. This helped the model to better generalize insights across different user actions.", "utterranceID": "20270111-4-5722f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-4-5722f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92c62291", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:32:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid approach. Thanks for handling this so efficiently, George!", "utterranceID": "20270111-5-a3c7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-5-a3c7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:35:00", "text": "Agreed, nice work! This should improve the model's performance significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270111-6-3bb0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-6-3bb0b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-12T01:36:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice and Ian! Let me know if you notice any further issues or have additional feedback.", "utterranceID": "20270111-7-9b8c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270111-7-9b8c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T09:57:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270114-0-70100"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-0-70100"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:00:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Contextual Misinterpretation' issue. The AI is misinterpreting user actions, leading to irrelevant insights. This affects the AI Analysis Engine and is impacting customer CUST-0120. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270114-1-8a942"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-1-8a942"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:01:00", "text": "Got it, I'll dive into the AI Analysis Engine and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270114-2-5d6cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-2-5d6cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:02:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_5782059f! Next, we have an 'Invalid Redirect URI Handling' issue. Third-party apps are facing errors during OAuth flow, affecting the API Authentication Module. This is impacting customer CUST-0031. @eid_5782059f, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20270114-3-ae069"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-3-ae069"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:04:00", "text": "Understood, I'll check the API Authentication Module and fix the redirect URI handling. Let's get those third-party integrations back on track! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270114-4-1cb13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-4-1cb13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:09:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks again! Lastly, we have an 'Anomaly Detection Failure' in the Report Generation & Data Processing area. Reports aren't highlighting significant anomalies, which is a big issue for customer CUST-0031. @eid_b4d260c1, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270114-5-12fa2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-5-12fa2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-14T10:13:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the anomaly detection logic and ensure reports are accurate. We can't have users making decisions on faulty data. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270114-6-98315"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270114-6-98315"}
