{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3e076e53", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:09:00", "text": "Got it, thanks for the heads-up! I'll start looking into securing the serialization process to prevent unauthorized access. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270106-2-2e52a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-2-2e52a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:12:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. API requests are being throttled unexpectedly due to incorrect settings, impacting the API Layer. This is causing issues for developers and applications relying on consistent data retrieval. Customer affected is CUST-0078. @eid_54905dcb, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270106-3-e7691"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-3-e7691"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:16:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll review the rate limiting configurations and make the necessary adjustments to ensure smooth API operations. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270106-4-ce99a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-4-ce99a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-28f51f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2027-01-06T13:21:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Delayed Response in Interactive Dashboards'. Users are experiencing significant delays when interacting with data visualizations in the UI. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module and is causing frustration for CUST-0077. @eid_4555ba9c, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270106-5-de034"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270106-5-de034"}
